{"id":"torrey:ammonites-the","source":"torrey","name":"Ammonites, The","slug":"ammonites-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descent of — Ge 19:38.","refs":[["Gen",19,38,19,38]]},{"text":"Children of Lot. — De 2:19.","refs":[["Deut",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Children of Ammon. — Jer 25:21.","refs":[["Jer",25,21,25,21]]},{"text":"Governed by hereditary kings — 2Sa 10:1.","refs":[["2Sam",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"Belonged to the Zamzummims. — De 2:20,21.","refs":[["Deut",2,20,2,20],["Deut",2,21,2,21]]},{"text":"Bordered on the Amorites. — Nu 21:24.","refs":[["Num",21,24,21,24]]},{"text":"as fertile. — Jer 49:4.","refs":[["Jer",49,4,49,4]]},{"text":"Well fortified. — Nu 21:24.","refs":[["Num",21,24,21,24]]},{"text":"Half of, given to the Gadites. — Jos 13:25.","refs":[["Josh",13,25,13,25]]},{"text":"Cruel and covetous. — Am 1:13.","refs":[["Amos",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Proud and reproachful. — Zep 2:10.","refs":[["Zeph",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Vindictive. — Eze 25:3,6.","refs":[["Ezek",25,3,25,3],["Ezek",25,6,25,6]]},{"text":"Fond of ornaments. — 2Ch 20:25.","refs":[["2Chr",20,25,20,25]]},{"text":"Idolatrous. — Jdj 10:6; 1Ki 11:7,33; 2Ki 23:13.","refs":[["Judg",10,6,10,6],["1Kgs",11,7,11,7],["1Kgs",11,33,11,33],["2Kgs",23,13,23,13]]},{"text":"Superstitious. — Jer 27:3,9.","refs":[["Jer",27,3,27,3],["Jer",27,9,27,9]]},{"text":"Rabbah. — 2Sa 12:26,27; Jer 49:3.","refs":[["2Sam",12,26,12,26],["2Sam",12,27,12,27],["Jer",49,3,49,3]]},{"text":"Ai. — Jer 49:3.","refs":[["Jer",49,3,49,3]]},{"text":"Perpetual exclusion from the congregation. — De 23:3; Ne 13:1.","refs":[["Deut",23,3,23,3],["Neh",13,1,13,1]]},{"text":"No covenant to made with. — De 23:6.","refs":[["Deut",23,6,23,6]]},{"text":"Not to be distressed. — De 2:19; 2Ch 20:10.","refs":[["Deut",2,19,2,19],["2Chr",20,10,20,10]]},{"text":"Assisted Eglon against Israel — Jdj 3:12,13.","refs":[["Judg",3,12,3,12],["Judg",3,13,3,13]]},{"text":"With the Philistines oppressed Israel for eighteen years — Jdj 10:6-9.","refs":[["Judg",10,6,